  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And we have villains to pursue!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_Captain_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Captain_Powe_AH-PRIM_036.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765224,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Where? How? Is the ship in any condition to sail? And would you know where to sail to? Where precisely is the Forbidden City the Akashic Core came from?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-PRIM_027.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756060,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It would be helpful if Bartleby showed up to teleport us like he did before.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Tarrak_Hadfield_AH-PRIM_028.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1761075,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But he hasn't. And yet we are here. He had to have seen the monster attack and he didn't warn us. There must be a reason, we are here for a reason.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-PRIM_028.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756060,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Mayhap your Bartleby is a scurvy bilge-rat.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_Captain_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Captain_Powe_AH-PRIM_037.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765224,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Or he knew we'd all survive and find something here we need. But why not just appear and tell us?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Tarrak_Hadfield_AH-PRIM_029.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1761075,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Perhaps he can't. Perhaps he needs trees to manifest and the wretched spell trees here are inadequate to the task. I might be able to help with that.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-PRIM_029.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756060,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I can possibly rejuvenate a Life Tree with enough raw life essence. Anything will really do. Perhaps pick the Scant Plantlife on the island.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-PRIM_030.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756060,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And the creatures here - the Stargazers - some of their slime should be helpful as well. I'll go scout for a suitable tree.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-PRIM_031.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756060,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And I'll watch his back. See you soon, Wizard.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Tarrak_Hadfield_AH-PRIM_030.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1761075,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
